 100 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: passes as is
 400 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: passes as is
 600 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: folds to 400 Hz
 900 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: folds to 100 Hz
1100 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: folds to 100 Hz
1900 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: folds to 100 Hz
2350 Hz sampled at 1000 Hz: folds to 350 Hz
wheel at  60 rpm: spokes pass at 12.00 Hz, film shows forwards
wheel at 100 rpm: spokes pass at 20.00 Hz, film shows backwards
wheel at 115 rpm: spokes pass at 23.00 Hz, film shows backwards
wheel at 125 rpm: spokes pass at 25.00 Hz, film shows forwards
wheel at 240 rpm: spokes pass at 48.00 Hz, film shows frozen in place
